#question(title: [Many axis of rotation])[
  Let $R$ be the region in the first quadrant
  bounded between the curves with equations
  $display(y = x^3)$ and
  $display(y = sqrt(32 x))$.

  Compute the volume of the solid of
  revolution obtained by rotating $R$
  around...
  + ... the $x$-axis
  + ... the $y$-axis
  + ... the line $y = - 1$
]
